Todd Cohen writes:
 > Hey guys,
 > 	I just installed FreeBSD 4.0/AXP the other day, switching from
 > linux and netbsd. I used to have some applications working perfectly on
 > Linux/AXP, but when I've tried using them on FreeBSD, I get the
 > following..
 > 
